total is 17 minutes.**\n\n| Step | Move | Time | Elapsed |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 1 and 2 cross together | 2 | 2 |\n| 2 | 1 returns with the torch | 1 | 3 |\n| 3 | 5 and 10 cross together | 10 | 13 |\n| 4 | 2 returns with the torch | 2 | 15 |\n| 5 | 1 and 2 cross together | 2 | 17 |\n\n**Why this is best:** The two slowest travellers (5 and 10) should cross together, so the 5-minute person's time is absorbed into the 10-minute crossing. The 1 and 2 travellers are already on the far side after step 1. One of them can bring the torch back, so neither the 5 nor the 10 has to walk back.\n\nThe obvious alternative, where the 1-minute person escorts everyone, costs 2 + 1 + 5 + 1 + 10 = 19 minutes. If 5 and 10 cross separately, the two slow trips alone cost 15, plus at least 2 for the return trips and 2 for the last forward trip, giving at least 19. Crossing together is the only way to get below 19, and 17 is the best such schedule."}},{"key":"message.uuid","value":{"stringValue":"b50a8f59-5c13-4ca5-ae7c-7b9cfe0c36c3"}},{"key":"model","value":{"stringValue":"claude-sonnet-5-5"}},{"key":"query_source","value":{"stringValue":"sdk"}}],"droppedAttributesCount":0,"flags":1,"traceId":"a6edea91b4a9067e709c46c596d952a5","spanId":"abf4bec9d4c3c8dc"},{"timeUnixNano":"1791360628967000000","observedTimeUnixNano":"1791360628967000000","body":{"stringValue":"claude_code.plugin_loaded"},"attributes":[{"key":"user.id","value":{"stringValue":"9dee9f65567ec67a776e6bd17470c4fb10efb1be85854fa3029d1ed43cfc6ba3"}},{"key":"session.id","value":{"stringValue":"961652a7-fabd-4479-80b7-fa514a191190"}},{"key":"terminal.type","value":{"stringValue":"ghostty"}},{"key":"event.name","value":{"stringValue":"plugin_loaded"}},{"key":"event.timestamp","value":{"stringValue":"2026-10-07T08:10:28.967Z"}},{"key":"event.sequence","value":{"intValue":5}},{"key":"prompt.id","value":{"stringValue":"ca9d7c48-63b8-46eb-8c5e-a7632146215b"}},{"key":"plugin.name","value":{"stringValue":"agents-md"}},{"key":"marketpla